                <pb facs="0477" n="465" sameAs="frus:frus1937v01/pg465"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">852.00/7054: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Spain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Bowers</hi>), <hi rendition="#italic">Then in France, to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">St.
                                Jean de Luz</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-12-11T12:00:00+00:00">December 11,
                        1937—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received December 11—9:55 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>410. Announcement is made that beginning today and until December 25th the
                    frontier will be hermetically sealed. This indicates the opening of the long
                    delayed offensive.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bowers</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
